                "value": "咕咕",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "紧急速报——紧急速报——\n疑似拖把的物体正在……咕？",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1300501_1345523620_content",
                "value": "紧急速报——紧急速报——\n疑似拖把的物体正在……咕？",
