      {
        "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.CfgDialogGroup, Assembly-CSharp",
        "desc": null,
        "textMaxIndex": 0,
        "textGroupId": "1300501_3",
        "useFixedDialogGroup": false,
        "fixedDialogGroupId": 0,
        "dialogs": {
          "$type": "System.Collections.Generic.List`1[[miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp]], mscorlib",
          "$values": [
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1300501_1345523623_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "啊，还没来得及介绍，\n<style=Highlight>「奇迹花车」</style>——\n最受欢迎的活动组织者！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1300501_1345523623_content",
                "value": "啊，还没来得及介绍，\n<style=Highlight>「奇迹花车」</style>——\n最受欢迎的活动组织者！",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1345523623
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1300501_1345523624_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "掌握星海最新资讯、搜罗星球趣闻，\n在星空街市举办盛会、开展活动，\n驾驶着奇迹花车，连接每一个星球的快乐。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1300501_1345523624_content",
                "value": "掌握星海最新资讯、搜罗星球趣闻，\n在星空街市举办盛会、开展活动，\n驾驶着奇迹花车，连接每一个星球的快乐。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1345523624
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1300501_1345523625_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "所以星球生长到一定的阶段，\n都会建造自己的演播厅，\n也就需要「奇迹花车」派驻专业的主播——",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1300501_1345523625_content",
                "value": "所以星球生长到一定的阶段，\n都会建造自己的演播厅，\n也就需要「奇迹花车」派驻专业的主播——",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1345523625
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "鹊可",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1300501_1345523626_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "非常抱歉，我其实……\n还只是实习主播。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1300501_1345523626_content",
                "value": "非常抱歉，我其实……\n还只是实习主播。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
