                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "不过，如果可以，我想为您的星球，\n播报各种新闻趣事、活动消息。\n不知道……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
